SparseSGD.Logistic.V2.fast_conjugation (a θ R Δ : ℝ) (hΔ : 0 < Δ) :
  SparseSGD.Logistic.V2.fastT Δ * SparseSGD.Logistic.V2.jacobianMatrix a θ R Δ * (SparseSGD.Logistic.V2.fastT Δ)⁻¹ =
    √Δ • SparseSGD.Logistic.V2.fastOmega a θ R + SparseSGD.Logistic.V2.fastDamping
