                      SparseSGD.Logistic.matchedOrbit (SparseSGD.Scaling.scaledLearningRate etaStar alpha d)
                        (SparseSGD.Scaling.scaledMomentum epsStar gamma d) (p d) (mu d) (SparseSGD.Logistic.coldState d)
                        k'‖ ≤
                  C * √(Real.log ↑d / ↑d)}
SparseSGD.Logistic.actual_fluid_power_cells_three_four
  (H : ∀ (n : ℕ), SparseSGD.External.BernsteinMomentsCertificate (SparseSGD.Logistic.Sample n))
