    SparseSGD.Scaling.Helps.Einf d ν ps SparseSGD.Scaling.Helps.sgdClass / SparseSGD.Scaling.Helps.Sinf d ν ps {β}
SparseSGD.Scaling.Helps.vocab_full_sgd_S {n d B : ℕ} {ν : MeasureTheory.Measure ℝ} {ps : Fin (n + 1) → ↑unitInterval}
