                                        (p.windowOsc s (↑k * p.matchedStep)).re / 2)| ≤
                                  C * (p.matchedStep + 1 / √p.matchedDelta) *
                                    (p.comparisonInitialSize s + p.renormAdditive)
SparseSGD.window_continuum_rate_bound (delta u : ℝ) (hd : 1 ≤ delta) (hu0 : 0 ≤ u) (hu1 : u < 1) :
  0 ≤ 1 - u - SparseSGD.continuumPerronRate delta u ∧ 1 - u - SparseSGD.continuumPerronRate delta u ≤ 1 / (4 * delta)

